      "body": "## Summary\n\n- Set `zmq.RCVTIMEO`/`zmq.SNDTIMEO` (5s) on the DEALER socket in `_moriio_handshake` so `recv_multipart()` no longer blocks forever\n- On timeout (`zmq.Again`), retry the full handshake with exponential backoff (1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, 16s)\n- After 5 retries, raise `HandshakeError` with diagnostics\n- Listener side is already idempotent — no changes needed\n\nRelated: ROCm/mori#759\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Existing `test_moriio_connector.py` still passes\n- [ ] Dead peer triggers timeout + retry log messages instead of hanging forever\n- [ ] Healthy handshake completes on first attempt with no behavior change",
